<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="th">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>ระบบจัดการงาน | ลุงบุญมี</title>
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Kanit:wght@300;400;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        body { font-family: 'Kanit', sans-serif; background: radial-gradient(circle at top right, #1e293b, #020617); }
    </style>
</head>
<body class="flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen p-4">

    <div class="w-full max-w-md bg-slate-900/80 backdrop-blur-xl border border-slate-700 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] shadow-2xl">
        <div class="text-center mb-10">
            <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-amber-500 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4 shadow-lg shadow-amber-500/20">
                <span class="text-3xl">🏗️</span>
            </div>
            <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-white mb-2">ลุงบุญมี รับเหมา</h1>
            <p class="text-slate-400">เข้าสู่ระบบหลังบ้านเพื่อจัดการงาน</p>
        </div>

        <% if (locals.error) { %>
            <div class="mb-6 p-4 bg-red-500/10 border border-red-500/20 text-red-400 rounded-2xl text-center text-sm animate-pulse">
                <%= error %>
            </div>
        <% } %>

        <form action="/api/login" method="POST" class="space-y-6">
            <div>
                <label class="block text-sm text-slate-400 mb-2 ml-1">ชื่อผู้ใช้</label>
                <input type="text" name="username" required 
                    class="w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-4 text-white placeholder:text-slate-600 focus:border-amber-500 outline-none transition-all duration-300">
            </div>
            <div>
                <label class="block text-sm text-slate-400 mb-2 ml-1">รหัสผ่าน</label>
                <input type="password" name="password" required 
                    class="w-full bg-slate-950 border border-slate-700 rounded-2xl p-4 text-white placeholder:text-slate-600 focus:border-amber-500 outline-none transition-all duration-300">
            </div>
            
            <button type="submit" 
                class="w-full bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-500 to-amber-600 hover:from-amber-400 hover:to-amber-500 text-slate-900 font-bold py-4 rounded-2xl text-lg transition-all transform hover:scale-[1.02] active:scale-[0.98] shadow-xl shadow-amber-500/20">
                เข้าสู่ระบบ
            </button>
        </form>

        <div class="mt-8 text-center">
            <a href="/" class="text-slate-500 text-sm hover:text-amber-500 transition-colors">← กลับหน้าหลัก</a>
        </div>
    </div>

</body>
</html>